// pvp-sdk: Tele Block (pvp_kit/scripts/tele_block.rs2): level 85, a law, death and chaos rune,
// 80 xp. The cast and travel graphics are Curse's; the impact is 377's (tele_block.spotanim).
[magic_spell_tele_block]
table=magic_spell_table
